  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 302.08 American Woodcock.\n\n(a) Pursuant to authority granted by RSA 209:6-b, and in accordance with 50 CFR Part 20, the season for taking woodcock shall open on October 1 and close on November 14 each year.\n\n(b) Taking of woodcock shall be limited to a daily bag of 3, and a possession limit of 9.\n\n(c) Daily shooting hours shall begin one-half hour before sunrise and end at sunset.\n\nSource. #1444, eff 9-22-79, paragraphs (b) & (c); amd by #1799, eff 8-24-81; ss by #2131, eff 9-8-82; amd by #2455, eff 8-28,83; ss by #2833, eff 8-21-84; amd by #3115, eff 9-16-85; ss by #4119, eff 8-21-86; ss by #4463, eff 7-29-88; #5870, eff 7-19-94; ss by #6553, eff 7-23-97; ss by #7739, EXEMPT, eff 8-1-02; ss by #7757, EXEMPT, eff 8-22-02; ss by #8943, EXEMPT, eff 7-18-07; ss by #9985, EXEMPT, eff 8-24-11; ss by #10400, EXEMPT, eff 8-21-13; renumbered by #13376 (formerly Fis 302.09); ss by #14238, EXEMPT, eff 4-18-25; ss by #14557, EXEMPT, eff 4-18-26",
